hazy, deep-blue mountain valley.\n<Subject 1> is the female protagonist in <Picture 1>, dressed in the emerald-green robe with a jade earring, standing alone in the nocturnal mountain environment established by <Picture 2>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A 10-second cinematic 3D CGI sequence. Under a desolate night mountain road, <Subject 1> walks alone along the asphalt near a yellow sign reading \"2 MOUSE ➔\". Pausing beneath the lone amber streetlight, her melancholic gaze drifts toward the distant, hazy city lights, conveying profound solitude, regret, and a quiet sense of destiny against the vast night landscape.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the protagonist's face, blue eyes, dark hair, jade earring, and emerald robe are meticulously retained.\n<Picture 2> (appears throughout [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the cracked asphalt, the \"2 MOUSE ➔\" sign, the guardrail, the lone streetlight, and the distant city lights are fully preserved as the backdrop.\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - her melancholic expression and character identity are faithfully preserved throughout her walking and pausing actions.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video adopts a high-quality 3D CGI cinematic animation style. The color palette creates a strong contrast between the vast, desaturated cool blue of the night mountains and the isolated, warm amber cone of the solitary streetlight. A shallow depth of field is utilized to softly blur the distant city lights and cliff edges, enhancing the dreamlike and lonely atmosphere.\n[Shot 1] From 00:00.000 to 00:03.000, the shot opens with a medium-wide angle capturing <Subject 1> walking gracefully from the left side of the frame along the curb beneath the cliff. The amber streetlight from <Picture 2> casts a warm rim-light on her hair and the edge of her emerald-green robe, illuminating the cracked asphalt with double yellow lines. She steps slowly and deliberately, her eyes fixed slightly downward with a faint, troubled expression. As she passes by the guardrail, the yellow road sign reading \"2 MOUSE ➔\" becomes visible in the foreground.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts to a dramatic close-up, focusing tightly on <Subject 1>'s face, mirroring <Picture 1>. She slowly halts her steps beneath the streetlight. Her blue eyes reflect the warm glow, as she lifts her gaze slightly, looking melancholically into the distant dark abyss of the valley. Her jade earring sways gently in the cold night breeze. She breathes softly, her expression turning from troubled to a profound, serene resignation, pausing for a silent moment of reflection.\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.500, the shot cuts to a wide, sweeping panoramic angle. The camera follows her gaze, revealing the vast expanse of the distant city lights glowing faintly in the mist-covered valleys, obscured by the rugged mountain terrain. <Subject 1> steps closer to the guardrail and gently turns her head, letting the wind blow through her loose hair strands. \n[Shot 4] At 00:07.500, the camera transitions into a slow, dramatic dolly-out. The frame expands, revealing her gradually diminishing silhouette against the immense night sky and the winding road. She slowly turns her back to the city view, her figure fading into the shadow of the rocky cliff. The screen fades into a deep black at exactly 00:10.000.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA deeply immersive nighttime mountain soundscape spans the full 10 seconds. The crisp, subtle rustling of her robe brushing against the wind, the soft tapping of her shoes on the cracked asphalt, and the intermittent chirping of distant night insects. As the camera pulls back in the final seconds, a faint, low hum of the distant city, carried by the mountain wind, fills the air before slowly fading into a profound, silent ambiance at the end.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA melancholic, ethereal Chinese instrumental score. Th